(
    title: "The Entity",
    developer: Some("Mark Klein"),
    description: Some("Fox\'s unreleased tie-in to the 1982 horror film inverts it: you ARE the invisible demon, rising plane by plane of existence through portals, herded between two containment walls the joystick slides — while liquid helium, the film\'s weapon against the Entity, sprays up to slow your ascent. Eight variations run to expert with the Entity itself turned invisible. Never released; the sole prototype was archived in 2002 and 250 boxed repro copies followed."),
